{"code":"004890","name":"동일산업","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"철강","sector_desc":"철강재 생산·가공. 중국 공급, 원료(철광석·석탄) 가격, 건설·조선 수요에 연동되는 경기 민감 업종입니다.","desc":"동사는 1966년 주강, 특수강 및 합금철 등의 제조를 목적으로 설립되었으며, 1997년 (주)동일철강을 흡수합병하고 2005년 유가증권시장에 상장하였음. 종속회사로 자동차 등속조인트 부품 제조업을 영위하는 디오토모티브(주)를 보유하고 있음. 사업부문은 봉강, 합금철, 주조사업부로 구성되어 자동차부품용 봉강, 제강용 합금철, 건설기계 부품 등을 생산하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-16","n_days":300,"close":34750.0,"open":34450.0,"high":35100.0,"low":34350.0,"volume":753,"amount":26166750.0,"ret_1d":-0.2869,"gap":-1.1478,"range_pct":2.1583,"ret_5":-1.5581,"ret_20":-6.0811,"ret_60":-2.5245,"ret_120":-7.3333,"ret_250":-11.352,"ma20":34915.0,"ma60":35184.1667,"ma120":35803.75,"ma200":36944.5,"close_vs_ma200":-5.94,"close_vs_ma60":-1.234,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":8.2448,"r2_60":0.0485,"slope_120":-14.5098,"r2_120":0.3073,"slope_250":-13.5803,"r2_250":0.6744,"high52":42150.0,"low52":32000.0,"pos_52w":27.0936,"dd_52w":-17.5563,"mdd_1y":-18.1258,"atr14_pct":3.5766,"vol_ann_60":27.0729,"vol_avg20":1691.8,"vol_ratio20":0.4451,"vr5":4.5435,"vr20":1.0615,"amount_avg5":178267150.0,"amount_avg20":58897090.0,"amount_avg60":44422031.6667,"obv_chg20":4.2381,"turnover_20":1.3952,"pv_eff_20":-4.3587,"rsi14":47.1957,"frgn_net_5":-465.0,"inst_net_5":74.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0192,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0031,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0161,"frgn_net_20":-2054.0,"inst_net_20":22.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0847,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0009,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0838,"frgn_net_60":-5381.0,"inst_net_60":987.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.2219,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0407,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.1812,"frgn_net_120":12335.0,"inst_net_120":-1079.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.5086,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0445,"smart_net_120_pct":0.4641,"foreign_ratio":3.88,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.41,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":81.0,"op_margin_q":7.8565,"op_qoq":179.3103,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":910.0,"rev_yoy":16.761,"op_trend_4q":99.7183,"fin_period":"202606","roe":0.84,"debt_ratio":14.38,"per":23.79,"pbr":0.18,"div_yield":2.88